WEBVTT

00:00:05.601 --> 00:00:08.771
If you truly loved her....

00:00:11.482 --> 00:00:15.444
No one can know.

00:00:15.486 --> 00:00:18.113
DUMBLEDORE: That I should never reveal
the best of you, Severus?

00:00:18.155 --> 00:00:19.323
SNAPE:
Your word.

00:00:19.365 --> 00:00:22.409
DUMBLEDORE: When you risk your life
every day to protect the boy?

00:00:22.451 --> 00:00:26.121
SNAPE: He possesses no measurable talent,
his arrogance rivals that of his father...

00:00:26.163 --> 00:00:28.165
...and he seems to relish his fame.

00:00:28.207 --> 00:00:31.210
HARRY:
Don't say a word against my father.

00:00:31.251 --> 00:00:33.587
SNAPE:
James Potter?

00:00:33.629 --> 00:00:35.255
Lazy, arrogant.

00:00:35.297 --> 00:00:36.757
HARRY:
My father was a great man.

00:00:36.799 --> 00:00:38.676
Your father was a swine!

00:00:40.511 --> 00:00:42.304
SNAPE:
Drink the rest.

00:00:42.346 --> 00:00:46.517
It will contain the curse to your hand
for the time being.

00:00:46.558 --> 00:00:48.602
It will spread, Albus.

00:00:48.644 --> 00:00:50.354
DUMBLEDORE:
How long?

00:00:51.313 --> 00:00:53.816
SNAPE:
Maybe a year.

00:00:55.985 --> 00:00:57.277
Don't ignore me, Severus.

00:00:57.319 --> 00:00:58.946
DRACO:
Harmonia Nectere Passus.

00:00:58.988 --> 00:01:02.992
We both know Lord Voldemort
has ordered the Malfoy boy to murder me.

00:01:05.035 --> 00:01:09.415
But should he fail,
one should presume the Dark Lord...

00:01:09.456 --> 00:01:11.583
...will turn to you.

00:01:14.336 --> 00:01:18.382
You must be the one to kill me, Severus.

00:01:18.424 --> 00:01:20.592
It is the only way.

00:01:21.552 --> 00:01:26.056
Only then will the Dark Lord
trust you completely.

00:01:26.098 --> 00:01:28.767
SNAPE:
Avada Kedavra.

00:01:32.021 --> 00:01:36.942
DUMBLEDORE: There will come a time
when Harry Potter must be told something.

00:01:38.527 --> 00:01:43.824
But you must wait until Voldemort
is at his most vulnerable.

00:01:43.866 --> 00:01:46.910
Must be told what?

00:01:46.952 --> 00:01:49.121
DUMBLEDORE:
On the night Lord Voldemort...

00:01:49.163 --> 00:01:52.374
...went to Godric's Hollow to kill Harry...

00:01:53.375 --> 00:01:56.086
...and Lily Potter cast herself
between them...

00:01:56.879 --> 00:01:58.797
...the curse rebounded.

00:02:00.591 --> 00:02:04.344
When that happened,
a part of Voldemort's soul...

00:02:04.386 --> 00:02:09.349
...latched itself onto the only living thing
it could find:

00:02:09.391 --> 00:02:11.560
Harry himself.

00:02:12.895 --> 00:02:16.315
There's a reason Harry can speak
with snakes.

00:02:16.899 --> 00:02:19.735
There's a reason he can look into
Lord Voldemort's mind.

00:02:22.071 --> 00:02:28.160
A part of Voldemort lives inside him.

00:02:34.583 --> 00:02:37.544
So when the time comes...

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:40.589
...the boy must die?

00:02:42.508 --> 00:02:44.676
Yes. Yes.

00:02:44.718 --> 00:02:46.970
He must die.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:10.119
You've kept him alive
so that he can die at the proper moment.

00:03:13.789 --> 00:03:16.375
You've been raising him
like a pig for slaughter.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:21.964
Don't tell me now that you've grown
to care for the boy?

00:03:26.468 --> 00:03:29.721
SNAPE:
Expecto Patronum.

00:03:40.649 --> 00:03:42.151
Lily.

00:03:45.404 --> 00:03:47.406
After all this time?

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:52.327
Always.

00:03:58.458 --> 00:04:01.587
So when the time comes...

00:04:01.628 --> 00:04:04.756
...the boy must die?

00:04:04.798 --> 00:04:08.302
Yes. He must die.

00:04:08.343 --> 00:04:11.346
And Voldemort himself must do it.

00:04:11.763 --> 00:04:13.974
That is essential.

00:05:18.997 --> 00:05:20.207
HERMIONE:
Where've you been?

00:05:20.249 --> 00:05:23.543
-We thought you went to the forest.
-I'm going there now.

00:05:23.585 --> 00:05:26.546
RON:
Are you mad? No.

00:05:27.256 --> 00:05:29.758
You can't give yourself up to him.

00:05:33.095 --> 00:05:35.013
HERMIONE:
What is it, Harry?

00:05:36.556 --> 00:05:38.475
What is it you know?

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:43.855
There's a reason I can hear them...

00:05:44.439 --> 00:05:45.691
...the Horcruxes.

00:05:48.193 --> 00:05:50.570
I think I've known for a while.

00:05:51.989 --> 00:05:54.283
And I think you have too.

00:05:57.244 --> 00:06:00.414
-I'll go with you.
-No, kill the snake.

00:06:01.123 --> 00:06:03.292
Kill the snake and then it's just him.

